{
  "name": "Day 12 Solution: Webhooks & APIs 101",
  "description": "HTTP Request patterns: no-auth call, retry-on-fail against a 500 endpoint, header/query API-key auth, 429 detection, and Split In Batches processing.",
  "tags": [
    "week-02",
    "day-12",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 12 Solution: Webhooks & APIs 101\n\nManual Trigger fans out to: a no-auth GET, a retry-configured GET against a guaranteed-500 endpoint, a header-auth GET (OpenWeatherMap), a status-code IF check for 429, and a Split In Batches loop over manually-set items. Credentials needed: One free-tier API key (e.g. OpenWeatherMap) for the header-auth call; everything else needs no auth.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_12_Webhooks_APIs_101.md.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "http1",
      "name": "Get Public Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users/1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http2",
      "name": "Get With Retry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://httpbin.org/status/500",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "retry": {
            "maxTries": 3,
            "waitBetweenTries": 2000
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http3",
      "name": "Get With API Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.openweathermap.org/data/2.5/weather",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "q",
              "value": "London"
            },
            {
              "name": "appid",
              "value": "your_openweathermap_api_key"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if1",
      "name": "Handle Rate Limit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": 429
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set1",
      "name": "Log Rate Limit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "note",
              "value": "rate limited, would retry"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set2",
      "name": "Set Batch Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        320,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "items",
              "value": "={{ [{id:1},{id:2},{id:3},{id:4},{id:5}] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code1",
      "name": "Split Items to List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "return items[0].json.items.map(i => ({ json: i }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sib1",
      "name": "Batch Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        800,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 2,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http4",
      "name": "Fetch Item Detail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/{{ $json.id }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http5",
      "name": "Deliberate Typo URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/postsxyz",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
